{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"","category":"储能","country":"东南亚","country_iso":"UNK","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:56.269329","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"UNK-ES-0003","ldc":"","location":"东南亚","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"东南亚10MWh离网储能项目","project_name_en":"Southeast Asia 10MWh Off-grid Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科能源","content":"近期，全球领先的储能公司晶科储能（Jinko ESS）成功签约东南亚地区10兆瓦时离网储能系统，为偏远地区的工厂和实体提供可靠的可再生能源电力。该项目采用两套晶科储能 G2 5MWh液冷系统和两套最先进的2.5MVA 晶科 PCS一体机，计划于2025年第三季度投入使用。该项目是晶科储能在东南亚的首个离网工业级项目。\n晶科的离网解决方案采用专业的离网应用设计，具备晶科 PCS 的并网（GFM）能力、真正的黑启动功能和 VSG 运行模式，为该地区提供可获得、可负担和可靠的绿色电力供应。晶科储能系统可与发电机组和光伏电站并网运行，循环效率高达94%，可大幅减少90%的柴油消耗。尽管东南亚属于热带气候，但晶科储能先进的液冷技术可将电池间温度控制在 ±2.5°C 以内，而多级防火隔离和人工智能驱动的热控制技术则确保了极致的安全性。\n“东南亚的能源转型需要强大的技术基础。王熙，晶科储能亚太区总经理表示：“晶科储能很荣幸能为该地区的新兴储能市场提供我们的储能解决方案。”","content_sha256":"5fb21996bd0f5f71287f960498c9f5c0394082d0d39d8116987bd745850b2280","id":3199,"publish_date":"2025-06-17 13:13:30","title":"晶科储能在东南亚签约10MWh储能离网系统","title_sha256":"e35af88da153139d82904d2577cd62c4b3e4075db843d4fee58c59655b549ce4","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/84069.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"UNK-ES-0003","capacity_details":"BESS: 10MWh","capacity_mw":10.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"10","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:56.269466","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"UNK-ES-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.jinkosolar.com/site/newsdetail/2636\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"晶科储能科技有限公司","project_developer_en":"Jinko ESS","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"晶科储能将在东南亚地区建设一个10MWh的离网储能系统项目，为偏远地区提供可再生能源电力。该项目是晶科储能在东南亚的首个离网工业级项目，计划于2025年第三季度投入使用。","publish_date":"2025-06-17 13:13:30","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/84069.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":10.0,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"UNK-ES-0003","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
